msgid "Empty Controller - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 1"
msgstr "空控制器 - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:83
#: 535f0d6ea99f435b88513eb8b610aa69
msgid ""
"The empty controller does not do any calculations. It is created to make "
"it easier to copy and implement your new controller. The main controller "
"is not reset when switching from an empty controller."
msgstr "空控制器不进行任何计算。它的创建是为了方便复制和实现新控制器。从空控制器切出时不会重置主控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:88
#: 9c8268f703774cb287c9e242b96825a7
msgid "PID Controller - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 2"
msgstr "PID 控制器 - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:90
#: 78b2d6db30a54c528ca7e2a33f561017
msgid ""
"The PID controller backend has the same controller architecture as the "
"main controller. It doesn't have any safeguarding mechanism such as "
"acceleration limiting or rate limiting. The default gains are scaled 0.9 "
"times to differentiate the custom controller response from the main one. "
"Since this controller does not have acceleration limiting, specifically a"
" square root controller, it would be safer to give a gentle command while"
" flying with it. Although it has the same architecture as the main one, a"
" proper reset functionality is not implemented intentionally to make it "
"easier to detect the effect of improper resetting."
msgstr ""
"PID 控制器后端与主控制器具有相同的控制器架构。它没有任何安全保护机制，如加速度限制或速率限制。默认增益按 0.9 "
"倍缩放，以区分自定义控制器与主控制器的响应。由于该控制器没有加速度限制（特别是平方根控制器），在飞行时给出平缓指令会更安全。虽然架构与主控制器相同，但有意未实现完整的复位功能，以便更容易检测不当复位的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:93
