#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:162
#: 89e27603142c42bea01ba4b9ea2cd602
msgid "PID and README files are omitted to keep it simple."
msgstr "PID 和 README 文件已省略以保持简洁。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:164
#: 4c9576917ae44165b0bf82d53c24e8da
