"**Step #3:** Change every class name, function definition etc. from "
"``AC_CustomControl_Empty`` to ``AC_CustomControl_XYZ`` inside "
"``AC_CustomControl_XYZ.cpp`` and ``AC_CustomControl_XYZ.h`` files. This "
"would look like this for the header file"
